    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000tif5](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000tif5) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Aug 05 2026 31km SW of Sarangani. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 5.1757 longitude 125.2809. It impacted 33476 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
